{"3832870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Car Football", "steam_appid": 3832870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Football</strong> blends high-speed driving with the precision of competitive football. Time your hits, control the ball, and send it rocketing into the net. Every match is a showcase of reflexes, positioning, and smart plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI in <strong>1v1, 2v2, and 3v3</strong> game modes. Read the bounce, outmaneuver defenders, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Master 20+ Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and master <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong>, each with distinct handling and visuals. Find the ride that fits your style and refine your technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Driven Ball Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bounce, deflection, and pinch is physics-based. Master plays, taps, and crucial saves to turn close matches into highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill-based, physics-driven football on wheels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1v1, 2v2, 3v3</strong> vs adaptive AI</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong> with distinct handling and looks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>5 unique stadiums</strong> with varied atmospheres</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast matches designed for instant action and replayability</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Football</strong> blends high-speed driving with the precision of competitive football. Time your hits, control the ball, and send it rocketing into the net. Every match is a showcase of reflexes, positioning, and smart plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI in <strong>1v1, 2v2, and 3v3</strong> game modes. Read the bounce, outmaneuver defenders, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Master 20+ Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and master <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong>, each with distinct handling and visuals. Find the ride that fits your style and refine your technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Driven Ball Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bounce, deflection, and pinch is physics-based. Master plays, taps, and crucial saves to turn close matches into highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.poster.avif?t=1758750499\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.webm?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.mp4?t=1758750499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill-based, physics-driven football on wheels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1v1, 2v2, 3v3</strong> vs adaptive AI</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong> with distinct handling and looks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>5 unique stadiums</strong> with varied atmospheres</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast matches designed for instant action and replayability</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Car Football is high-speed football on wheels. Play 1v1, 2v2, or 3v3 matches against AI, unlock 20+ unique cars, and compete in 5 stunning stadiums with physics-driven gameplay for skillful, action-packed matches.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Finnish, Dutch, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/6859bef161f617da41ac015590e1493a0a2ff0c7/header.jpg?t=1758750499", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.s